OL,3,ADoing these things now will help you
OL,4,Asave money at Christmas
OL,5,
OL,6,FHow soon is too soon when it comes to
OL,7,Fthinking about Christmas and your
OL,8,Ffinances?
OL,10,FThe answer, of course, is that it is
OL,11,Fnever too soon. Save early and the cost
OL,12,Fbecomes more manageable.
OL,14,FThe squeeze is harder for some than
OL,15,Fothers, with charity Barnardo's warning
OL,16,Fthat some parents will skip meals so
OL,17,Ftheir kids get a Christmas dinner with
OL,18,Fthe trimmings.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
